      "name": "VAT Codes",
      "description": {
        "content": "In some regions, VAT codes are part of your *ERP* **Masterdata**, that\nrepresent timeboxed VAT codes and VAT values that Vic.ai can automatically\nassign to invoice line items.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
